# Addresses through a division by a parameter. One the lanes of a warp
# compute alike is the variable uniform(%r@line), and the warp's
# sectors are counted as for a parameter base; a quotient that differs
# by lane, read after a loop lanes leave at different trips, copied
# there, minus lane 0's shuffle of it, or copied under a guard on the
# thread index, stays unknown, and why is named. A quotient computed in
# a loop varies with the loop's iteration, so the loop's unique bytes
# are unknown. An unknown address leaves the kernel's bytes exact:
# micro_uniform_div_lanes stores 256 B per CTA.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/uniform_address.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r4; // global store [4·%tid.x + 256·uniform(%r3@38) + param_0] sectors/req 4–5 (ideal 4){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry micro_uniform_div_lanes( // block 64×1×1 | per CTA: global store 256 B; param load 768 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r2; // global store addr ? (div by a non-constant divisor){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}$L__BB2_1: // loop: trips 4 | global per CTA: requested 2,048 B, unique ? | warp * × lane * | exec 256/CTA{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r3; // global store [4·%tid.x + 256·uniform(%r4@81) + param_0] sectors/req 4–5 (ideal 4){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd5], %r3; // global store [4·%tid.x + 256·⌊uniform(%r4@81)/8⌋ + param_0] sectors/req 4–5 (ideal 4){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r2; // global store addr ? (div by a non-constant divisor){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r2; // global store addr ? (uniform(%r4@138) differs between lanes: depends on %tid.x){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r2; // global store addr ? (uniform(%r4@165) differs between lanes: depends on %tid.x){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.global.u32 	[%rd3], %r2; // global store addr ? (%r6 is written under a guard){{$}}
